  <h1>Hot Nitro Coffee</h1>
  <p>Hot nitro coffee can be served on demand from the Craft Draft keg system.</p>

  <h2>The Craft Draft process</h2>
  <p>Coffee is brewed and packed into kegs protected by nitrogen. When you want a cup, the keg system serves it hot from the tap, ready to pour.</p>

  <h2>Why serve nitro coffee from kegs?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Nitrogen protects the coffee in the keg, which preserves quality.</li>
    <li>Less preparation and less mess: no brewing, grinding or pouring from pots.</li>
    <li>Hot nitro coffee is available on demand, cup by cup.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>See the <a href="/kegerators/">hot nitro dispenser</a>, learn <a href="/nitro-cold-brew/">all about nitro cold brew</a> or find out <a href="/howtobuy/">how to buy</a>.</p>
</Base>
